<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
It seems you have viewed every letter, report and side-tale reference."<PG>
"I believe the background of this world has, for the most part, been brought to light."<PG>
